'''Maize Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Invasion of the Swamplord]] appearing on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' days of every month. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

{{Cat Info
